title: "SkinGuard AI"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hameed
    given-names: Muhammad
    affiliation: "CECOS University of IT and Emerging Sciences, Peshawar"
repository-code: "https://github.com/muhammad-hameed-ai/skinguard-ai"
abstract: >-
  Offline melanoma screening for smartphones. Quantifies and partially
  closes the dermoscopy-to-clinical domain gap (AUC 0.494 to 0.778) and
  adds out-of-distribution gating so non-lesion images are refused rather
  than scored.
keywords:
  - melanoma
  - domain adaptation
  - on-device inference
  - out-of-distribution detection
  - model calibration
